//	Share panel
"Image size"				= "画像サイズ";
"Transparent background"	= "背景なし";	// or "透明な背景"
	//	Tom Sawada says
	//	I think either of "透明な背景" or "背景なし" is appropriate.
	//	Personally, "no background" (the second option) sounds
	//	slightly more natural to me (simply because it is a phrase
	//	you would hear more often than "transparent background"),
	//	but I think it is only a matter of preference. If you want
	//	to emphasize that the figure does have a background, then
	//	"transparent background" (the first option) may be a better choice.
"Save"						= "保存";
